        "slc_836fc175d5568ebdcf0fbe3ae3dfae81c7d59a03fa3b3913b1d5a0dbda197b22"
      ],
      "text": "The runtime targets Python 3.10+ and lists roughly 30 LLM providers including native formats (Anthropic, DeepSeek, Gemini, OpenAI), OpenAI-compatible vendors, and local servers (Ollama, vLLM, SGLang) requiring no API key."
    },
