  "summary": "Selected evidence records: The product exposes a CLI with subcommands including tui, web, login, logout, config, and --version, plus a headless -p/--print mode for non-interactive runs. The interactive UI is a TypeScript Ink TUI that spawns a Python agent-server child and communicates over an NDJSON pipe; running clawcodex with no mode flags launches it.",
